@sheet Data
@header | Amount | Units |
| 10 | 1 |
| 20 | 2 |
| 30 | 3 |
| 40 | 4 |
| 50 | 5 |

@sheet Window
@header | Metric | Value |
| Amount slice | =SUM(!!Amount[2:4]) |
| Unit slice | =SUM(!!Units[3:5]) |

@sheet Final
@header | Metric | Value |
| Carry | =Window!B2+Window!B3 |
| Amount copy | =Window!B2 |
